@startuml

' ============================================================
' DIAGRAMA DE SECUENCIA UML — OuTime
' Flujo real: Reserva de una cita — V2
' ============================================================

title Diagrama de Secuencia — Reserva de una cita

hide footbox

' ============================================================
' ESTILO — DESIGN SYSTEM OUTIME
' ============================================================

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam dpi 150

skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F8F6
    ParticipantBorderColor #2F5D50
    ParticipantFontColor #20352F
    ParticipantFontSize 12

    ActorBackgroundColor #EDF4F1
    ActorBorderColor #2F5D50
    ActorFontColor #20352F
    ActorFontSize 12

    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FBF9
    LifeLineBorderColor #8AA69C

    ArrowColor #5F766E
    ArrowThickness 1.1

    MessageFontColor #20352F
    MessageFontSize 11

    GroupBackgroundColor #F4F8F6
    GroupBorderColor #2F5D50
    GroupFontColor #2F5D50
    GroupFontSize 12

    DividerBackgroundColor #EDF4F1
    DividerBorderColor #2F5D50
    DividerFontColor #2F5D50
    DividerFontSize 12
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #EDF4F1
    BorderColor #8AA69C
    FontColor #20352F
    FontSize 10
}

' ============================================================
' PARTICIPANTES
' ============================================================

actor "Cliente" as Cliente

participant "BookingScreen" as BookingScreen
participant "ScheduleViewModel" as ScheduleVM
participant "ScheduleRepositoryImpl" as ScheduleRepo
participant "AppointmentViewModel" as AppointmentVM
participant "AppointmentRepositoryImpl" as AppointmentRepo
database "Firestore" as Firestore


' ============================================================
' FASE 1 — CARGA DE DISPONIBILIDAD
' ============================================================

== Preparación de disponibilidad ==

BookingScreen -> ScheduleVM : Observar horario del negocio

ScheduleVM -> ScheduleRepo : observeSchedule(businessId)

ScheduleRepo -> Firestore : Escuchar business_schedules/{businessId}
Firestore --> ScheduleRepo : Datos del horario
ScheduleRepo --> ScheduleVM : Horario actualizado
ScheduleVM --> BookingScreen : Actualizar estado del horario


BookingScreen -> ScheduleVM : Observar fechas bloqueadas

ScheduleVM -> ScheduleRepo : observeBlockedDates(businessId)

ScheduleRepo -> Firestore : Escuchar blocked_dates
Firestore --> ScheduleRepo : Fechas bloqueadas
ScheduleRepo --> ScheduleVM : Fechas actualizadas
ScheduleVM --> BookingScreen : Actualizar estado


' ============================================================
' FASE 2 — CONSULTA DE DISPONIBILIDAD
' ============================================================

== Consulta de disponibilidad ==

Cliente -> BookingScreen : Seleccionar fecha

BookingScreen -> AppointmentVM : loadAppointmentsByBusinessAndDate(...)

AppointmentVM -> AppointmentRepo : getAppointmentsByBusinessAndDate(...)

AppointmentRepo -> Firestore : Consultar appointments\npor negocio y rango de fecha
Firestore --> AppointmentRepo : Citas del día

AppointmentRepo --> AppointmentVM : Lista de citas
AppointmentVM --> BookingScreen : Actualizar citas del día

BookingScreen -> ScheduleVM : generateTimeSlots(...)

ScheduleVM -> ScheduleVM : Generar franjas disponibles

note right of ScheduleVM
Se consideran:
- horario del negocio
- fechas bloqueadas
- franjas pasadas
- citas existentes
end note

ScheduleVM --> BookingScreen : TimeSlot disponibles / ocupados


' ============================================================
' FASE 3 — CONFIRMACIÓN
' ============================================================

== Confirmación de la cita ==

Cliente -> BookingScreen : Pulsar "Confirmar cita"

BookingScreen -> BookingScreen : isBookingDateStillAvailable()

alt Fecha no disponible

    BookingScreen --> Cliente : Mostrar Snackbar\n"El día ya no está disponible"

else Fecha disponible

    BookingScreen -> AppointmentVM : createAppointment(appointment)

    AppointmentVM -> AppointmentVM : Crear Appointment\nstatus = CONFIRMED

    AppointmentVM -> AppointmentRepo : createAppointment(appointment)

    AppointmentRepo -> Firestore : document().set(appointment)

    alt Escritura correcta

        Firestore --> AppointmentRepo : Escritura completada
        AppointmentRepo --> AppointmentVM : Result.success(Unit)
        AppointmentVM --> BookingScreen : isSuccess = true

        BookingScreen -> BookingScreen : Mostrar Snackbar\n"Cita confirmada"

        BookingScreen -> AppointmentVM : resetState()

        BookingScreen -> AppointmentVM : loadAppointmentsByBusinessAndDate(...)

        AppointmentVM -> AppointmentRepo : getAppointmentsByBusinessAndDate(...)

        AppointmentRepo -> Firestore : Consultar citas actualizadas
        Firestore --> AppointmentRepo : Lista actualizada
        AppointmentRepo --> AppointmentVM : Lista de citas
        AppointmentVM --> BookingScreen : Actualizar franjas

    else Error en Firestore

        Firestore --> AppointmentRepo : Excepción
        AppointmentRepo --> AppointmentVM : Result.failure(e)
        AppointmentVM --> BookingScreen : error = e.message

        BookingScreen -> BookingScreen : Mostrar Snackbar\n"Error: {mensaje}"

        BookingScreen -> AppointmentVM : resetState()

        BookingScreen --> Cliente : Permanecer en la pantalla\nsin crear la cita

    end

end


' ============================================================
' NOTA SOBRE EL FLUJO
' ============================================================

note over BookingScreen,AppointmentRepo
La disponibilidad se valida previamente en la interfaz.
La creación de la cita se realiza mediante una escritura
directa en Firestore.
end note

@enduml